{"id":"ab87a8c0ba50d579","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-bracket-abstraction.md","title":"括号抽象的替换性质","display":"thm-bracket-abstraction — 括号抽象的替换性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-bracket-abstraction","aliases":["56-thm-bracket-abstraction"],"display":"thm-bracket-abstraction — 括号抽象的替换性质","depends_on":["[[56-df-bracket-abstraction]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]","[[56-df-relation-closure]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Propositions 3.3.8,3.3.10 and proofs, printed p68","source_ocr_block":"89","verification_status":"source-proofs-read; local-structural-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-bracket-abstraction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-bracket-abstraction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bracket-abstraction — 括号抽象的替换性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"223292dccac5188a\" href=\"?note=223292dccac5188a\" title=\"56-df-bracket-abstraction\">56-df-bracket-abstraction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Propositions 3.3.8,3.3.10 and proofs, printed p68"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"89"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-proofs-read; local-structural-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(t,u\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span>，括号抽象见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"223292dccac5188a\" href=\"?note=223292dccac5188a\" title=\"56-df-bracket-abstraction\">56-df-bracket-abstraction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=u]\">\\(t[x:=u]\\)</span> 是一阶替换：将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 并固定其他变量，再同态扩张；CL 中没有变量绑定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}([x]t)=\\mathrm{Var}(t)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\qquad([x]t)u\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*t[x:=u].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Var}([x]t)=\\mathrm{Var}(t)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\qquad([x]t)u\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*t[x:=u].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Propositions 3.3.8、3.3.10（印刷 p68，OCR 页块89），本次已读证明。对 t 归纳：变量/常元分支由 I、K 规则立即成立；应用分支由 S 规则变为两次递归调用。变量集合等式也逐构造成立，并比原书“x 不再出现”的陈述更明确地记录剩余变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-bracket-abstraction","status":"resolved","id":"223292dccac5188a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-bracket-abstraction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-bracket-abstraction","status":"resolved","id":"223292dccac5188a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $x\\in V$、$t,u\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}$，括号抽象见 [[56-df-bracket-abstraction]]。$t[x:=u]$ 是一阶替换：将 $x$ 送到 $u$ 并固定其他变量，再同态扩张；CL 中没有变量绑定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"t[x:=u]","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}([x]t)=\\mathrm{Var}(t)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\qquad([x]t)u\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*t[x:=u].","display":true}],"bytes":1266,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-276","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-bracket-abstraction.md]]"},{"id":"5fe0a092a852ec82","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"023cbda9c2e76b96","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["223292dccac5188a","6aa7f56f36c897f4","9ddd157960e9574a"]}